      <h2>Grand Wailea &amp; Andaz Luau</h2>
      <h3>4. Grand Wailea Luau: A Luxurious Affair</h3>
      <p>For those desiring a touch of luxury, the Grand Wailea Luau at the Grand Wailea Resort is the epitome of opulence. Known for its world-class amenities, this luau combines the island's flavors with elegant entertainment. Guests can indulge in a sumptuous buffet featuring locally sourced ingredients and relax in the lap of luxury as they enjoy the breathtaking sunset over Wailea Beach.</p>
      
      <h3 style="margin-top: 24px;">5. Andaz Luau: Modern Elegance in Wailea</h3>
      <p>Situated at the Andaz Maui at Wailea Resort, this luau seamlessly blends traditional Hawaiian elements with a modern, chic vibe. The feast here is a fusion of classic Polynesian flavors and contemporary culinary artistry. The oceanfront setting, coupled with fire dancers and live music, creates an atmosphere that's both sophisticated and authentically Hawaiian.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

